OL,3,GNEWSAFormer knitwear factory to be
OL,4,Aturned into 54 flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to convert a former factory
OL,7,Fcomplex in Leicester into flats have
OL,8,Fbeen approved.
OL,10,FPlanning documents outlined proposals
OL,11,Ffor the change of use of the former
OL,12,Fknitwear factory known as Vinola House
OL,13,Fat 191 Ross Walk in Belgrave.
OL,15,FOfficers at Leicester City Council said
OL,16,Fapplicant Diamond Red Limited had
OL,17,Fsubmitted plans to convert the majority
OL,18,Fof the building into 54 flats and
OL,19,Foffice space.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
