OL,3,GNEWSAFormer knitwear factory to be
OL,4,Aturned into 54 flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe proposal is made up of 35 one-bed
OL,7,Fflats and 19 two-bed flats. The
OL,8,Fdevelopment was given the go-ahead by
OL,9,Fthe council on Wednesday.
